// 12:13: error: unknown type `Pt`; tests/scoped_reads_type_dep.kod declares `Pt`: write `scoped_reads_type_dep.Pt` or list it in the import (`{ Pt }`)
// 13:13: error: unknown type `Mode`; tests/scoped_reads_type_dep.kod declares `Mode`: write `scoped_reads_type_dep.Mode` or list it in the import (`{ Mode }`)
// 18:13: error: unknown type `Pt`; tests/scoped_reads_type_dep.kod declares `Pt`: write `scoped_reads_type_dep.Pt` or list it in the import (`{ Pt }`)
// 19:13: error: unknown type `Mode`; tests/scoped_reads_type_dep.kod declares `Mode`: write `scoped_reads_type_dep.Mode` or list it in the import (`{ Mode }`)
